# Local Tesseract.js assets for offline OCR.
#
# All four files below plus ../../tessdata/eng.traineddata must be present.
# main.js probes for them and only then passes workerPath / corePath /
# langPath; if any one is missing it falls back to the CDN for all of them.
#   tesseract.min.js          ← main library
#   worker.min.js             ← opts.workerPath
#   tesseract-core.wasm.js    ← opts.corePath
#   tesseract-core.wasm       ← loaded by the core glue, same directory
#
# Vendored version: 4.x (matches the v4 createWorker(lang, oem, opts) API).
#
# Verify with: npm run check
